  "reasoning": "The defendants (the company and its legal representative) used a government official's position to obtain a recommendation letter, allowing an unqualified company to illegally extract oil. They then paid the official 200,000 yuan as an improper reward for this facilitation. This conduct constitutes offering a bribe to a public official, which is the crime of \"行贿\" under Chinese criminal law. No other listed charges apply to the defendants.",
